  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FY24-25 ASEAN Renewable Energy (Course 2) In-Country</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The course will provide 30 participants with the required base knowledge to successfully project manage new renewable energy capacity developments from Cambodia, Lao PDR, Myanmar, Viet Nam, Philippines, Indonesia and Timor-Leste to upskill for future&#xa0;Renewable Energy development projects, such as Solar, Wind, Biofuel, Geothermal or Hydro projects.
Course 2 is being delivered in May 2025, at the University of Auckland</narrative>
  </description>
